# Billing — Provider webhook, internal route (M26-S04, UC-114)
# POST /internal/billing/webhooks/{provider}: the provider's JSON, forwarded by the BFF after it
# verified the provider token (the backend never sees the token). Tenant-less: the tenant is
# resolved from the provider customer id, or from the charge's externalReference. Answers EXACTLY
# 200 with an empty body; any non-2xx makes the provider retry. InternalApiGuard only.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#   Locally the provider is the in-process fake (BRL_FAKE): a paid event only applies to a charge the
#   fake knows, so these requests show the contract (status codes), not a payment; the end-to-end
#   money loop is covered by the integration spec and by M26-S35's E2E.
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl     = {{backendUrl}}
@internalKey = {{$dotenv INTERNAL_API_KEY}}

### A well-formed event for an unknown customer and an unknown charge: 200, no state change
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/webhooks/asaas
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_00000000000000000000000000000000&1",
  "event": "PAYMENT_RECEIVED",
  "dateCreated": "2026-11-19 12:00:00",
  "payment": {
    "id": "pay_unknown",
    "customer": "cus_unknown",
    "value": 49.0,
    "billingType": "PIX",
    "externalReference": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
  }
}

### An event type Ikaro does not act on: 200, nothing stored
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/webhooks/asaas
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt_00000000000000000000000000000000&2",
  "event": "PAYMENT_CHECKOUT_VIEWED",
  "dateCreated": "2026-11-19 12:00:00",
  "payment": { "id": "pay_unknown", "value": 49.0 }
}

### A provider this release cannot read (stripe is M28): 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/webhooks/stripe
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Missing internal key: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/webhooks/asaas
Content-Type: application/json

{}
